          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP426  - Medicine Hat Event&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I think this one has been taken out - the concrete here at the hint location doesn't match the older stuff around it.  &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_sad.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

