        <groundspeak:log id="361232504">
          <groundspeak:date>2013-10-27T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="2003571">Look 4 Us</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP426. TFTC!  A little busy by the Church this morning.  Parked as close as I could and used my vehicle to protect me from the traffic.  I had found this in 2010 but where it is located had a lot of water in it.  I was not able to clean it out.  This morning was dry and it is supposed to snow today, so I figured I had better get it now or wait until spring.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
